{"slug": "kinderen-naar-buiten", "synopsis": "This 1935 film shows KINABU\u2019s summer care for city children described in the source record as physically weak. On wooded grounds, adult attendants lead groups through circle games and exercises; an intertitle then links a day of sunshine and outdoor play to the image of a child asleep in bed. Children also eat together outside and spend time near country homes, gardens, and farm animals under adult supervision.\\\\n\\\\nThese scenes connect fresh air, nourishing meals, rest, play, and rural life with the program\u2019s aim of helping children regain strength. The source record says KINABU placed children with host families in the countryside and maintained a nursing home at Soesterberg for children whose health prevented such placement. Closing travel scenes show large groups waving from railway carriages, moving along platforms, leaving another vehicle, and gathering in a busy station, making clear the organization required to transport them.", "clips": [{"id": "f19acbad-5246-5d5b-ae31-35eb8828bee7", "sourceSlug": "kinderen-naar-buiten", "sourceTitle": "Kinderen naar buiten", "sourceYear": 1935, "position": 0, "startSeconds": 0.0, "endSeconds": 7.88, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/kinderen-naar-buiten/clips/0000000000-0000007880.mp4", "thumbnailUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/kinderen-naar-buiten/thumbnails/0000000000-0000007880.jpg"}, {"id": "c41d7172-0144-52e8-8ef5-ea520f04f0d4", "sourceSlug": "kinderen-naar-buiten", "sourceTitle": "Kinderen naar buiten", "sourceYear": 1935, "position": 1, "startSeconds": 7.88, "endSeconds": 21.16, "videoUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/kinderen-naar-buiten/clips/0000007880-0000021160.mp4", "thumbnailUrl": "https://pub-075ff01374c04555b51c9bc50f258b42.r2.dev/sources/kinderen-naar-buiten/thumbnails/0000007880-0000021160.jpg"}, {"id": "fd797381-9d3c-51d2-932f-6b51ceaa0783"